    "text": "<p>Given,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />Now finding,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable columnalign=\"left left right\"><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#916;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#916;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#916;</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mo>&#9651;</mo><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#9651;</mo></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mo>&#9651;</mo><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#9651;</mo></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mo>&#9651;</mo><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#9651;</mo></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math></p><p>Now points <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> are collinear</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns